{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "90ce26ef58d8bb8d0cef6460b8889f86290e2d6fe3084a9060c1e973ee00b7fa", "ja": "後戻りはできない！！！", "zh": "已经无法回头了！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6c2908d7918fa9fd1c5b30f4a7df95da3c77aade09d90fcf4a702c2e4d460c87", "ja": "スマホゲーム『エト戦記』のガシャ結果に、\n一喜一憂する部員たち。やがて同人誌即売会\n『コミベ』の申し込みが完了し、シンカや部\n員一同、最強の会誌を作ろう！　と気合いを\n入れるのだった。", "zh": "面对手机游戏《エト战记》的抽卡结果，成员们时而欢喜时而忧愁。最终，同人志即卖会《コミベ》的报名完成了，シンカ和全体成员都干劲十足地说道：让我们制作出最强的社团刊物吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "3e01601779c25d3da9bb2598959cb2372cd901f0d5cddb82c90449bab5f5b704", "ja": "トーコ！　もしかして、\n今からサークルに行くところ？", "zh": "透子！你该不会\n正要去社团吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "f1941168bf0305e707303ea998046f04a55f7c47280c053c0567ab099deaf3c1", "ja": "千花夏。\nええ、一緒に向かいましょうか。", "zh": "千花夏。\n嗯，我们一起过去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "5192504d20de783b035bb2951e57b07bf6aa5aed1efc8bbbf9dd31d9dad1e697", "ja": "ちな先輩、緑生さん！　待ってましたよ！\n今日からエト戦記のイベントですからね！", "zh": "千花夏前辈，绿生小姐！等你们好久了！因为从今天开始就是《艾特战记》的活动了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "9ac847c7d43655fec7e9601f7761a090f5e72a164074c0c41415fb4737abcf33", "ja": "イベント報酬の寅、シンカちゃんの推しだもんね。\n衣装の燕尾服アレンジ、超カッコイイし！", "zh": "活动奖励里的虎，是辛卡最喜欢的嘛。  \n服装采用燕尾服风格，超帅的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "837dabea2d44e4d5fe5344f0a53f9446ed25cdc570bb11fd220671051b9a5318", "ja": "そう！！　そうなんですよ～！！　連動ガシャの\n未はまだ引けてないんですけど……必ず！", "zh": "对！！就是这样～！！联动扭蛋里的“未”还没抽到……但一定会抽到的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "5d6bc58adc4437d8c85500dbd73156f67cd1b717e89c5d995184cdd8a2ccb840", "ja": "？　あれ……Lichtちゃんの画面に映っているのは\n……もしかして☆5の未、もう引けたんですか！？", "zh": "？咦……Licht的画面上显示的是……难道已经抽到☆5未了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "c23bb2ffb4fb504db9b51be3314d56c46d95d2a0d625a78127998d0199916cce", "ja": "うん？\n今朝回したら、来てくれたよ～。", "zh": "嗯？\n今天早上抽的时候，她就来啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "ca18f39b1e2c03cccddf1c8c01240f1da3759b8a94b06cd04063cc423f024045", "ja": "何もかも、持っているのか……。", "zh": "难道什么都有吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "5ac6359ff446b2cb616e38f378a9d2a25716211da6333c0be9da7d71ed7f7c51", "ja": "ああっ、シンカちゃん！　しっかり！", "zh": "啊啊！深夏，振作一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "6fbc1a82ef3a98f21ce4febc9117ccffbbd29c6ee41d82a08f0d91c7b74ca1c0", "ja": "りこ……アタシの理性がなくなる前に……\nコンビニで例のカードに変わる前に、これを……！！", "zh": "莉子……在我失去理智之前……\n在它还没在便利店变成那张卡之前，把这个……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "c1e45e5955dfa9c6f16f198a3a0dab6d469c5644b614368d0fa2ef6c59f736fa", "ja": "こ、これは今月のサークル会費……！\n確かに受け取りました、シンカちゃん！", "zh": "这、这是这个月的社团会费……！\n我确实收到了，亲香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "e94c60e97e85bd2f9d7731b76dbf7c34cbc93455d9f6aa3b0347e78e2e853d4f", "ja": "でしたら……会費も集まった事ですし、\nイベントに申し込んでしまいましょうか？", "zh": "既然这样……会费也收齐了，要不要报名参加活动呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "867153c66ebcc2302c8c13cdc503099d6aa5faae152d8706da50e942c94a26c3", "ja": "これで不備はないはず……よし。\nGWスペシャルコミベ、申し込み完了しました。", "zh": "这样应该就没有问题了……好。\nGW特别漫展，报名完成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "4676a9f619dbc3dff379ee7827087f0fdb911c1b16caa6ca9b8ebe28053d531d", "ja": "ふふっ、申し込んじゃった。\nこれでもう、後戻りはできないって事だね。", "zh": "呵呵，已经报名了。\n这下就没法回头了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "6cdb980ba4c7a1a8c1afa29c1b532764534af92263fee8c5e608e44836534d3f", "ja": "アタシとりこは個人サークルもあるから、\n会誌と自分の新刊、最低でも2冊分か……。", "zh": "我和莉子都有个人社团，所以社团刊物加上自己的新刊，至少得准备2本……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "7f9a7bbc0fc656dac3bcc9560db1d561235cac3e319cb71df7dfb7b7144bf447", "ja": "ううっ、頑張らないと～！　マンガが間に合わないから\nって、イラスト本にするわけにはいかないからね！", "zh": "呜呜，得加把劲了～！总不能因为漫画赶不上，\n就改成插画本嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "8fe8dd44f78f1c96f85d9c51364e948901b8e5e19c6bbbaf9ff58a445a4991e1", "ja": "わ、私はイラスト本でもいいんですケド……。", "zh": "我、我觉得画集也没关系啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "76159322fa6642c37b476c34085087c5a9c9f19be9cb2e97991024e17a858095", "ja": "りこちゃんのカラーイラスト、\nすっごく綺麗だもんね！", "zh": "里子的彩色插画，真的特别漂亮呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "2c8798aaef86552758f9525ebfe053bc59d45d8a14cfb75187015e716e64676f", "ja": "か、カラー1枚が2ケタ万円オーバーするような\n神作家に言われても……！　それより今は会誌です！", "zh": "彩、彩色插画1张就要超过2位数万日元的神级画师这么说……！比起这个，现在要紧的是会刊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "cb51ba839d28a46ff5927660f26b4e6fa979850ebce6f203aa9037009a3c8bee", "ja": "とりあえず、打ち合わせをしましょう！\n印刷所を決めて、〆切を出さなくちゃです！", "zh": "总之，先开个碰头会吧！\n得先决定印刷厂，再定下截稿日期才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1020_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "1f45608ed5a6f4ebb1fdfb402ae252d47969cfaf9193c5fe34b072da34747447", "ja": "うん。平均的にページも割れたし、これなら……\nあっ、いけない！　そろそろバイトの時間だ！", "zh": "嗯。页数也分得很平均，这样的话……\n啊，糟糕！差不多到打工的时间了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_02_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "966bae476ad1ec6b3211d9880dede316ff6e114146e68226ae026c845c2f33bd", "ja": "アタシ、これで失礼します！\nみんな、頑張って、最強の会誌作ろうね！", "zh": "我先告辞了！\n大家加油，一起制作出最强的会刊吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
